#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Welcome to amaroK!</h1>\n"
"<p><b>There are many media-players around these days, this is true. amaroK "
"however provides an aural experience so pleasurable it always has you coming "
"back for more. What is missing from most players is an interface that does not "
"get in your way. amaroK tries to be a little different, and at the same time "
"intuitive. It provides a simple drag-and-drop interface that makes playlist "
"handling simple and fun. By using amaroK we truly hope you will:</b></p>\n"
